{
  "job_B1.8.4.4_20251001_193259": {
    "chunk_text": "life, gesette twa bec urum saulum to h\u00e6le: an ys seo Cristes Petrus bodode on Antiochian byrig, & \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6ron \u00e6rest gecwedene cristene men \u00feurh hine, & he Paulus ferde wide geond \u00feas woruld bodiende manegum leodscipum, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he on last becom in to & Nero het \u00fea hine beheafdian on \u00feam ylcan d\u00e6ge, \u00fee he aheng Petrum. Andreas bodode on Achaian lande & on Scithian, & he sy\u00f0\u00f0an wear\u00f0 on rode ahangen for \u00fe\u00e6s Iacob se gingra, \u00fee w\u00e6s Iohannes bro\u00feor, bodode \u00feam Iudeiscum \u00fee w\u00e6ron tostengte, \u00feam twelf Iohannes his bro\u00f0or bodode on Asia, on easteweardan worulde, & he ne wear\u00f0 na ofslagen, ac \u00e6fter Philippus bodode \u00feam h\u00e6\u00f0enum folce wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re s\u00e6 sylfre, & he si\u00f0\u00f0an gewat to H\u00e6rapolim & wear\u00f0 Thomas bodode on Parthon & Medon & on Yrcaniam, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he com to Indian & \u00fe\u00e6r wear\u00f0 ofslagen Bartholomeus bodode on Indian, on \u00fe\u00e6re fyrran Indian, & \u00fe\u00e6r wear\u00f0 ofslagen. Matheus bodode on Ethiopian lande, \u00fe\u00e6t synd \u00fea Silhearwan, & se kining hine ofsloh, na se gelyfeda, Iacob se rihtwisa wunode on \u00feam lande binnan Hierusalem bodiende geleafan o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea Iudeiscan Simon & Iudas samod w\u00e6ron gemartyrode on Persida lande for Cristes geleafan, on \u00f0am \u00fee hi Mathias bodode on Iudea lande, se \u00fee w\u00e6s gecoren on Iudan stede, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6ra apostola getel wurde Ealra \u00feissera apostola geendunge ic h\u00e6bbe awriten",
